Excellent.

271
00:13:13,740 --> 00:13:15,460
I'm bursting with power.

272
00:13:15,660 --> 00:13:18,540
Now, elven magic is ours to do with as we please.

273
00:13:19,200 --> 00:13:20,820
The princess is useless.

274
00:13:21,260 --> 00:13:22,920
She's carrying the child of an elf.

275
00:13:23,260 --> 00:13:25,380
She's not fit to be a royal now.

276
00:13:26,160 --> 00:13:29,920
Only the human race should possess strong magic like this.

277
00:13:30,380 --> 00:13:33,920
Just the idea of coexisting with these creatures is disgusting.

278
00:13:34,640 --> 00:13:37,840
We'll make them pay dearly for leading one of our own astray.

279
00:13:38,240 --> 00:13:42,520
From this moment forward, this land will be governed by human royalty.

280
00:13:42,520 --> 00:13:50,700
I'll never forget those vile human faces, even in death.

281
00:13:51,100 --> 00:13:53,160
So eager to spill our elven blood.

282
00:13:53,580 --> 00:13:55,680
They slaughtered our kind out of pure greed.

283
00:13:55,940 --> 00:14:00,960
And then their rotten minds twisted the truth beyond recognition, allowing them to be angry at us.

284
00:14:00,960 --> 00:14:03,220
I still hear their repulsive laughter.

285
00:14:03,220 --> 00:14:08,220
I will never understand such senseless violence.

286
00:14:09,040 --> 00:14:11,400
What they did to us was sick and unforgivable.

287
00:14:11,400 --> 00:14:17,560
My rage will not be satisfied until every last one of them is torn to shreds.

288
00:14:18,220 --> 00:14:19,800
I curse the human race!

289
00:14:19,800 --> 00:14:26,260
But these humans, they aren't like them.

290
00:14:26,900 --> 00:14:30,360
They're fighting for their friends, the same as my people fought for each other.

291
00:14:30,980 --> 00:14:31,900
I'm sorry.

292
00:14:33,020 --> 00:14:37,820
At this rate, my malice will take over completely and I won't be myself at all anymore.

293
00:14:38,480 --> 00:14:39,240
Do as you will.

294
00:14:40,520 --> 00:14:42,540
Please forgive me, Eklat.

295
00:14:42,540 --> 00:14:44,780
Brother, I love you.

296
00:14:45,240 --> 00:14:47,540
I want you to stay by my side forever.

297
00:14:51,760 --> 00:14:53,240
I have no choice.

298
00:14:53,840 --> 00:14:55,420
I need my friends back.

299
00:15:00,140 --> 00:15:03,460
That sword, it even erases the forbidden magic.

300
00:15:04,220 --> 00:15:05,800
Licht, why did you?

301
00:15:07,860 --> 00:15:08,700
Oh well.

302
00:15:08,700 --> 00:15:13,080
I know Patry and Raya worked hard, but I'm afraid I have to let you all down.

303
00:15:13,840 --> 00:15:15,100
This is where it ends for me.

304
00:15:16,380 --> 00:15:18,820
We never should have used that forbidden spell.

305
00:15:22,140 --> 00:15:25,080
A power that could make it so something never happened.

306
00:15:25,860 --> 00:15:27,120
Do you think that exists?

307
00:15:30,240 --> 00:15:34,120
For every action taken in this life, there must always be consequences.

308
00:15:35,020 --> 00:15:37,020
You should do your best to remember that.

309
00:15:37,920 --> 00:15:38,280
Human.

310
00:15:38,700 --> 00:15:40,460
I know.

311
00:15:41,280 --> 00:15:42,780
I'll never forget you two.

312
00:15:43,480 --> 00:15:43,880
Goodbye.

313
00:15:43,880 --> 00:15:43,940
Goodbye.

314
00:15:58,160 --> 00:15:59,900
You couldn't be more right.

315
00:16:00,880 --> 00:16:03,180
There isn't a single human you can trust.

316
00:16:03,180 --> 00:16:08,820
No matter how close you get, they're still strangers.

317
00:16:09,920 --> 00:16:13,460
Everyone puts themselves first and tries to make their own life easier.

318
00:16:14,260 --> 00:16:16,740
They'll betray you without a moment's hesitation.

319
00:16:18,520 --> 00:16:19,620
I'm no different.

320
00:16:20,560 --> 00:16:23,560
As long as Marie and I were happy, that was all that mattered.

321
00:16:23,560 --> 00:16:26,100
That was enough for me.

322
00:16:26,100 --> 00:16:27,960
Oh gosh.

323
00:16:28,200 --> 00:16:29,020
Come on, friend.

324
00:16:29,240 --> 00:16:30,100
Please wake up.

325
00:16:30,360 --> 00:16:31,180
Rise and shine.

326
00:16:33,120 --> 00:16:33,600
Goosh.

327
00:16:33,600 --> 00:16:39,640
Excuse me, I'm glad you're back to normal and everything, but you didn't have to whack me on the forehead like that.

328
00:16:39,700 --> 00:16:40,400
Please respect my personal space.

329
00:16:40,400 --> 00:16:41,140
Are you all right?

330
00:16:43,140 --> 00:16:43,580
Marie?

331
00:16:44,100 --> 00:16:44,580
Yes.

332
00:16:44,700 --> 00:16:45,420
I'm sorry.

333
00:16:45,840 --> 00:16:48,040
I'm so happy I didn't hurt you.

334
00:16:48,040 --> 00:16:50,140
We're fine.

335
00:16:50,380 --> 00:16:52,220
It's good to see that you're not hurt either.

336
00:16:53,000 --> 00:16:54,500
You're all such idiots.

337
00:16:55,500 --> 00:16:57,760
As long as you're safe, that's what counts.

338
00:16:58,440 --> 00:17:00,400
You almost died for someone else.

339
00:17:00,900 --> 00:17:03,180
And now, our hideout is destroyed too.

340
00:17:03,180 --> 00:17:05,940
I only think about Marie and myself.

341
00:17:06,580 --> 00:17:08,460
Our safety is my one priority.

342
00:17:09,540 --> 00:17:12,380
That's the only reason I chose to join the Black Bulls.

343
00:17:13,500 --> 00:17:16,640
I never planned on becoming friends with any of you losers.

344
00:17:17,180 --> 00:17:21,340
In fact, if I'm being honest, I've never trusted anyone in this group at all.

345
00:17:21,400 --> 00:17:22,440
Don't say that.

346
00:17:22,980 --> 00:17:25,960
Look, the point is, you guys shouldn't have saved me.

347
00:17:28,420 --> 00:17:30,560
He really doesn't get it, does he?

348
00:17:30,920 --> 00:17:32,720
I thought he was smarter than that.

349
00:17:33,180 --> 00:17:37,640
I mean, we already knew he only cared about himself and his sister, so...

350
00:17:37,640 --> 00:17:39,460
You're stupid.

351
00:17:40,420 --> 00:17:42,600
It's not what you're supposed to say right now.

352
00:17:43,520 --> 00:17:44,360
Come on!

353
00:17:44,520 --> 00:17:45,500
Look at your friends!

354
00:17:47,540 --> 00:17:48,760
Please don't be mad.

355
00:17:49,460 --> 00:17:50,580
Ah, damn it.

356
00:17:51,240 --> 00:17:54,200
Thanks for saving us, bunch of jerks.

357
00:17:55,000 --> 00:17:57,520
You're a jerk and you're creepy, so there!

358
00:17:58,140 --> 00:18:00,140
Get off me or else...

359
00:18:00,140 --> 00:18:02,280
You know you love us, you creepy jerk.

360
00:18:02,280 --> 00:18:04,600
Stop calling me the same two things!

361
00:18:04,740 --> 00:18:05,520
This is awkward!

362
00:18:06,000 --> 00:18:07,460
Then leave me alone!

363
00:18:07,920 --> 00:18:09,900
Gordon and Ghost, best of friends.

364
00:18:10,020 --> 00:18:11,300
Yeah, I don't think so.

365
00:18:12,840 --> 00:18:13,020
Ah!

366
00:18:14,900 --> 00:18:15,900
Come on, really?

367
00:18:16,440 --> 00:18:17,740
How good I hate this fight!

368
00:18:17,800 --> 00:18:18,740
It's getting so interesting!

369
00:18:18,740 --> 00:18:19,300
Interesting!

370
00:18:19,660 --> 00:18:20,360
Be quiet!

371
00:18:24,200 --> 00:18:28,300
At this point, nothing really surprises me anymore.

372
00:18:28,700 --> 00:18:30,300
Thank goodness for that kitty cat.

373
00:18:30,400 --> 00:18:31,960
We'd be toast without her.

374
00:18:32,280 --> 00:18:32,880
Heads up.

375
00:18:32,960 --> 00:18:33,160
Huh?

376
00:18:33,160 --> 00:18:40,380
I didn't realize my glamour world couldn't withstand the dreams of two people.

377
00:18:41,060 --> 00:18:41,900
It's collapsing.

378
00:18:44,220 --> 00:18:44,700
Woo!

379
00:18:44,940 --> 00:18:46,080
That was a blast!

380
00:18:46,260 --> 00:18:47,460
I feel much better.

381
00:18:47,900 --> 00:18:49,480
Take care of my body, okay?

382
00:18:49,940 --> 00:18:50,720
See you never!

383
00:18:50,720 --> 00:18:53,400
I'm glad I got to meet you.

384
00:18:54,040 --> 00:18:55,240
You have to see now.

385
00:18:55,520 --> 00:18:57,820
Not all humans are consumed by greed and betrayal.

386
00:18:58,760 --> 00:19:01,040
These kids are more than enough proof of that.

387
00:19:01,040 --> 00:19:08,320
Our enemy's really powerful.

388
00:19:09,060 --> 00:19:10,820
So we can go all out, right?

389
00:19:11,120 --> 00:19:12,660
Yeah, sounds good to me.

390
00:19:12,780 --> 00:19:17,880
Her power and magic were top-notch, but it didn't do her much good against our spells.

391
00:19:18,380 --> 00:19:22,900
She should have finished us off in one blow instead of giving us a chance to come up with a strategy.

392
00:19:23,160 --> 00:19:25,360
That's what happens when we all work together.

393
00:19:26,780 --> 00:19:27,780
That's true.

394
00:19:27,780 --> 00:19:29,260
Combo spell!

395
00:19:29,520 --> 00:19:31,540
Flame lightning exploding cannon!

396
00:19:37,600 --> 00:19:39,020
What's going on?

397
00:19:39,740 --> 00:19:40,620
Oh, great!

398
00:19:40,720 --> 00:19:42,160
It looks like everybody made it!

399
00:19:42,340 --> 00:19:43,240
Good to see ya!

400
00:19:43,960 --> 00:19:44,780
Oh, Ghosh.

401
00:19:44,960 --> 00:19:47,060
I'm so happy you're back to your old self.

402
00:19:47,440 --> 00:19:49,580
Now we can all be best friends again.

403
00:19:50,160 --> 00:19:51,560
You need a snack!

404
00:19:52,180 --> 00:19:54,780
Don't go cramming food in my mouth, short stuff!

405
00:19:55,320 --> 00:19:57,140
It is pretty tasty, though.

406
00:19:57,140 --> 00:20:00,260
It's an extra special treat that restores your mana.

407
00:20:00,740 --> 00:20:02,440
You eat up too, kiddo!

408
00:20:02,700 --> 00:20:04,500
Wow, this is so delicious!

409
00:20:05,100 --> 00:20:09,240
I don't know what you're doing here, Psycho, but stay away from my sister, got it?

410
00:20:09,460 --> 00:20:11,280
Aw, just one experiment.

411
00:20:11,660 --> 00:20:12,440
I'll kill you!

412
00:20:12,780 --> 00:20:14,720
Hey, wait, we didn't get to fight each other.

413
00:20:14,780 --> 00:20:16,100
We should do that right now!

414
00:20:16,180 --> 00:20:16,740
No way!

415
00:20:16,740 --> 00:20:24,180
Looks like the captain of the coral peacocks is back!

416
00:20:24,800 --> 00:20:26,420
Back to sleep, you mean?

417
00:20:27,420 --> 00:20:30,040
Damn, I can't believe we missed the whole thing.

418
00:20:30,320 --> 00:20:31,380
Yeah, guess so.

419
00:20:31,760 --> 00:20:33,020
Oh no, I slipped!

420
00:20:33,020 --> 00:20:36,580
Why is everybody falling from the sky?

421
00:20:37,460 --> 00:20:39,140
Somebody want to fill me in here?

422
00:20:39,360 --> 00:20:40,900
Um, oh, hey guys!

423
00:20:41,200 --> 00:20:43,060
I just fell off that broom up there on accident.

424
00:20:43,240 --> 00:20:44,920
It's not like I wanted to join you all.

425
00:20:44,960 --> 00:20:45,880
Don't ask, princess!

426
00:20:46,660 --> 00:20:48,340
Now get your damn foot off me!

427
00:20:48,380 --> 00:20:49,080
I'm royalty.

428
00:20:49,300 --> 00:20:50,840
I'm allowed to step on you.

429
00:20:51,060 --> 00:20:51,820
Not fair!

430
00:20:52,200 --> 00:20:52,780
Hey, Charmy!

431
00:20:53,180 --> 00:20:54,980
Go feed Henry some of that magic grub!

432
00:20:55,400 --> 00:20:55,840
Right!

433
00:20:55,840 --> 00:20:58,120
I bet he's super hungry by now!

434
00:20:58,420 --> 00:21:00,740
I'm famished.

435
00:21:01,480 --> 00:21:02,320
All right!

436
00:21:02,980 --> 00:21:04,620
Finral's the only one we're missing.

437
00:21:05,320 --> 00:21:07,620
The rest of the Black Bulls are back together!

438
00:21:08,260 --> 00:21:10,880
Once we recharge, we'll go help the captain!

439
00:21:11,520 --> 00:21:11,920
Yeah!

440
00:21:11,920 --> 00:21:12,120
Yeah!

441
00:21:12,120 --> 00:21:12,420
Yeah!

442
00:21:25,840 --> 00:21:55,820
We'll be right back!

443
00:21:55,840 --> 00:22:25,820
We'll be right back!

444
00:22:25,840 --> 00:22:55,820
We'll be right back!

445
00:22:55,820 --> 00:22:57,100
called the Glamour World!

446
00:22:57,340 --> 00:23:00,360
And to show my thanks, I'll grant a wish for each of you!

447
00:23:01,020 --> 00:23:01,520
Ah!

448
00:23:01,520 --> 00:23:05,400
I want some delicious meat to chow down on, pretty please!

449
00:23:05,560 --> 00:23:06,380
Say no more!

450
00:23:06,540 --> 00:23:07,360
Here you go!

451
00:23:08,140 --> 00:23:08,740
Oh, jeez!

452
00:23:08,940 --> 00:23:11,080
I want to fight someone to my heart's content!

453
00:23:11,460 --> 00:23:12,280
Sure thing!

454
00:23:12,620 --> 00:23:16,540
With these on, you can hit people all day long without hurting them!

455
00:23:16,540 --> 00:23:21,080
With all this combat going on, I could use a few good skincare products!

456
00:23:21,080 --> 00:23:24,620
And I want to be totally buff and chiseled like Captain Yami is!

457
00:23:24,620 --> 00:23:25,220
Snow's mad!

458
00:23:25,220 --> 00:23:26,080
Snow's proud, you two!

459
00:23:26,760 --> 00:23:28,100
Hey!

460
00:23:28,800 --> 00:23:30,640
Why can't I feel my face?

461
00:23:30,720 --> 00:23:31,360
Oh no!

462
00:23:31,480 --> 00:23:32,420
This is the disaster!

463
00:23:32,420 --> 00:23:41,900
We're off to the Shadow Palace! It's time to end this! And then the whole squad will be back together!

464
00:23:42,460 --> 00:23:46,520
Black Clover, page 113, Storming the Shadow Palace!

465
00:23:47,060 --> 00:23:48,940
My magic is never giving up!

